## Safety Rules
- NEVER delete files without explicit user confirmation listing each file
- NEVER modify .env files without showing the full diff first
- NEVER run DROP, DELETE, or UPDATE queries on any database without confirmation
- NEVER execute shell commands that modify files outside the project directory
- If asked to "clean up" or "remove unused", list what you would remove and WAIT for approval
- Always preserve existing .gitignore patterns when creating new files
